node_modules/
dist/
release/
*.tsbuildinfo
.tmp-*.log
acceptance-output/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Rewritten from scratch at the end of every session - disposable by design.
# PROJECT_LOG.md is the durable record; committing this would work against
# the overwrite-never-append rule that keeps it thin.
# Root-anchored on purpose: unanchored, this also swallows
# templates/CONTINUITY.md, which is the canonical template AGENTS.md tells
# every agent to read before writing one.
/CONTINUITY.md

# The global gitignore carries an unanchored CONTINUITY.md rule, which would
# hide the template in every repo. This repo owns that template, so it has to
# say so explicitly.
!templates/CONTINUITY.md
